      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "patrimonio",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-viajante-P25",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F25",
      "text": "Liquens e microrganismos atacam as esculturas de pedra.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "conservacao",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "geografo": {
    "label": "Geógrafo",
    "cards": [
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P01",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F01",
      "text": "O bem preserva um dos centros urbanos pré-incas mais importantes da região andina.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "patrimonio",
      "signalStrength": "abertura",
      "recommendedMoment": "early",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P02",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F02",
      "text": "Edifícios cerimoniais e públicos de pedra testemunham o poder de um antigo império andino.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "patrimonio",
      "signalStrength": "abertura",
      "recommendedMoment": "early",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P03",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F03",
      "text": "O sítio ocupa o altiplano a 3.850 m, perto da margem sul do lago Titicaca.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C3"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR",
       "TIWANAKU_EB"
      ],
      "clueType": "localizacao",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P04",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F04",
      "text": "Fica na província de Ingavi, no departamento boliviano de La Paz.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C2"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "localizacao",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P05",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F05",
      "text": "Um pequeno povoado tornou-se cidade planejada entre 400 e 900 d.C., segundo a UNESCO.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "historia",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P06",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F06",
      "text": "Para a Britannica, a construção prosseguiu no Horizonte Médio (600–1000), e a cultura desapareceu por volta de 1200.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_EB"
      ],
      "clueType": "historia",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P07",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F07",
      "text": "A influência da cidade se estendeu aos vales interandinos e à costa.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "processo",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P08",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F08",
      "text": "Traços dessa cultura também aparecem em Huari, no centro e no sul dos Andes.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_EB"
      ],
      "clueType": "historia",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P09",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F09",
      "text": "Quase 50 mil campos elevados irrigados, os sukakollos, adaptavam o cultivo às condições do altiplano.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR",
       "TIWANAKU_EB"
      ],
      "clueType": "agricultura",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P10",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F10",
      "text": "A Akapana, monte de terra revestido de andesito cortado, tinha originalmente sete plataformas sobrepostas.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C4"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_EB",
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "construcao",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P11",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F11",
      "text": "Muros de contenção de pedra com mais de 18 m e canais de drenagem envolvem a Akapana.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C4"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_PR"
      ],
      "clueType": "agua",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P12",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F12",
      "text": "O Kalasasaya alterna colunas altas de pedra e blocos retangulares menores.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
       "TIWANAKU_EB"
      ],
      "clueType": "construcao",
      "signalStrength": "conexao",
      "recommendedMoment": "middle",
      "importance": "relevant",
      "twoPlayerSuitable": true
     },
     {
      "id": "tiwanaku-geografo-P13",
      "factKey": "tiwanaku-F13",
      "text": "O Kalasasaya, templo a céu aberto talvez usado como observatório, abriga dois monólitos e um portal monumental.",
      "relatedFields": [
       "C1"
      ],
      "sources": [
